scene U: {N} wants to know how it came about: what the new work is, whether it will last, and what it says about where work is going.
scene B: {friend} got lucky, and {N} is in the same job as five years ago. It stings more than {N} would admit.
scene R: The joy in the voice is catching. {N} wants to celebrate, loudly, tonight.
scene G: People find their place in time. {friend} has found theirs, and {N} is content where {N} is.
