works: The debt is settled or tamed, and {parent} admits it is a relief to have nothing hidden.
works: The drawer is empty by spring, and {parent} can laugh about it, a little, at the next family dinner.
fails: {parent} is mortified, and stops letting {N} near anything to do with money.
